        <obo:IAO_0000115>OBSOLETE. A cell that is found in a natural setting, which includes multicellular organism cells &apos;in vivo&apos; (i.e. part of an organism), and unicellular organisms &apos;in environment&apos; (i.e. part of a natural environment).</obo:IAO_0000115>
